{"1401930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BattleWars", "steam_appid": 1401930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to BattleWars!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An in development online casual shooter where you can play how you want on a variety of gamemodes such as team deathmatch, capture the flag, free for all, zombie defense, etc. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress as you play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn xp, money and level up to unlock more cosmetics and weapons with cool perks and drawbacks. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and join servers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create your own server for players to join or join already existing ones in the server browser.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Splitscreen mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your friends and/or family with up to 4 player local splitscreen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and watch demos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the replay editor to record, edit and publish your own demos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom community content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the BattleWars Mod Kit to create your own maps, gamemodes and more!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to BattleWars!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An in development online casual shooter where you can play how you want on a variety of gamemodes such as team deathmatch, capture the flag, free for all, zombie defense, etc. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress as you play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn xp, money and level up to unlock more cosmetics and weapons with cool perks and drawbacks. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and join servers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create your own server for players to join or join already existing ones in the server browser.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Splitscreen mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your friends and/or family with up to 4 player local splitscreen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and watch demos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the replay editor to record, edit and publish your own demos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom community content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the BattleWars Mod Kit to create your own maps, gamemodes and more!</p>", "short_description": "BattleWars is an in development online casual shooter where you can play how you want on a variety of gamemodes.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401930/header.jpg?t=1779715143", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779715143", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779715143", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 32-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 960 GTX<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 1080 GTX<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13.5 High Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</stro